{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:80b1a2c79ab5bbd6","name":"Noghri Warrior","source":{"id":"source:reference-80b1a2c79ab5bbd6","title":"Noghri Warrior","revision":19535,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:08:40Z","sha256":"2f1112011fca8b2db415345c2494c5fa68428cf7d56ce446376bdc8cbc598f89","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19535","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Noghri%20Warrior&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-80b1a2c79ab5bbd6","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Early in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Times"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Times"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Darth Vader"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Darth_Vader","referenceId":"reference:c167be702b56cffc"}," became aware of the decimated planet of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Honoghr"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Honoghr?action=edit&redlink=1"}," and its tough, gray-skinned sentient Species, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Noghri"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Noghri","referenceId":"reference:3b34c955e2b5b5b3"},". Under the guise of providing Imperial aid to restore ",{"tag":"a","children":["Honoghr"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Honoghr?action=edit&redlink=1"}," to its former glory, Vader was successful in indebting the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Noghri"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Noghri","referenceId":"reference:3b34c955e2b5b5b3"}," clans to himself and the Empire. At his disposal is an elite force of Noghri Warriors, and skilled ",{"tag":"a","children":["Noghri Infiltrators"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Noghri_Infiltrators?action=edit&redlink=1"},". They serve Vader willingly in repayment for his effort to save their world. In reality, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Noghri"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Noghri","referenceId":"reference:3b34c955e2b5b5b3"}," are dependent on the Empire for their very existence.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Noghri"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Noghri","referenceId":"reference:3b34c955e2b5b5b3"}," are small and fearsome. They prefer to use primitive weapons and hand-to-hand combat. They operate in near total secrecy. They are offworld only when carrying out missions for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Darth Vader"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Darth_Vader","referenceId":"reference:c167be702b56cffc"},", at which time Vader's agents always accompany them to facilitate travel and mission logistics and ensure their secrecy. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Noghri"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Noghri","referenceId":"reference:3b34c955e2b5b5b3"}," are fierce and dedicated fighters, with little understanding of humor even in their most relaxed moments. When operating on a mission, they are completely consumed by the task until its completion.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Noghri Warrior Statistics (CL 6)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Small ",{"tag":"a","children":["Noghri"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Noghri","referenceId":"reference:3b34c955e2b5b5b3"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scout"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scout","referenceId":"reference:8a1db462be753774"}," 3/",{"tag":"a","children":["Soldier"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Soldier","referenceId":"reference:f826baa05bef6921"}," 3\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},":"]}," 5; ",{"tag":"b